        "id": 11021,
        "name": "truednd",
        "username": "truednd",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/truednd/{size}/2419_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-18T20:44:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There was some contention yesterday when playing the first scenario and using Baron Blade's teleport movement power (I do not have the card currently with me, so I don't remember the exact name or the full wording of what the card says).</p><p>Because it does state that Baron Blade can choose a spot within line of sight, if he were to stand at Elevation 4, could he teleport to any spot at elevation 3 and/or 4 using this movement ability? Obviously he can only do it one time per turn, but just looking for clarification because I do remember that it only states that LOS is required for the movement, but doesn't list the exact range.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:14.066Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 2,
