        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>There was some contention yesterday when playing the first scenario and using Baron Blade&#39;s teleport movement power (I do not have the card currently with me, so I don&#39;t remember the exact name or the full wording of what the card says).</p><p>Because it does state that Baron Blade can choose a spot within line of sight, if he were to stand at Elevation 4, could he teleport to any spot at elevation 3 and/or 4 using this movement ability? Obviously he can only do it one time per turn, but just looking for clarification because I do remember that it only states that LOS is required for the movement, but doesn&#39;t list the exact range.</p>",
