        "created_at": "2014-08-18T21:36:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Note that it may not be every space of height 3 and 4 that he can see. If the Baron is on elevation 4, an intervening space of elevation 4 may block his Line of Sight to an elevation 3 space further on.</p>",
