        "created_at": "2014-08-19T00:09:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The main point, I think, was whether or not distance was a factor. And it’s not. Blade NEEDS that mobility. He isn’t that powerful in a face to face encounter, so he relies more in hit and run tactics. As expected from an evil scientist.</p>",
